ind":"announcement","title":"Devlog: Making Every Shot Count — Anatomy, Fair Aim and a Rebalanced Hunt","summary":"Hi hunters! This update was shaped by your feedback, so here is the story behind it.Every shot is judged by what it hitsA real hunter knows exactly where a good shot lands. Each animal now has organs placed inside its body: heart, lungs, liver, spine and more. Your score, your objectives and the new x-ray shot replay all follow what your bullet actually hit.Fair aim, real skillThe aim assist used to pull straight to the heart, which made perfect shots too easy. Now it guides you to the vital zon","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T01:36:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114038489","verified_at":"2026-10-24T06:55:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4832770-1847286114038484","game_id":"steam-4832770","kind":"update","title":"Big Update: Real Anatomy, X-Ray Shot Replays & a Full Balance Pass","summary":"Hi hunters! Thank you for all the feedback. I read every comment, and this update is the result.Real anatomyShots are now judged by the organ they hit: heart, lungs, liver, spine and more.New objectives and a Daily \"Vital Hunt\" reward clean, ethical shots.X-ray shot replaysGreat shots trigger a 3D x-ray replay that shows the bullet's path through the animal.Review your best shots from the shot reports.Balance and economyThe aim assist now guides you to the vital zone, not straight to the heart, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T01:35:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114038484","verified_at":"2026-10-24T06:55:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4832770-1847286114034513","game_id":"steam-4832770","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog: Hunters Trial Triples in Size - 120 Levels & New Modes","summary":"Hi hunters! Steam Next Fest gave us more feedback than we ever expected, and it pushed us to do something big before launch: the full game is now three times larger. Here is what changed.120 levels in 12 actsThe campaign grows from 40 to 120 levels. Every act brings something new:Animals that arrive in waves, and levels against the clock.Birds that start in flight.Protected species, and danger moments when a bear or boar charges you - one breath, one shot.Heavy fog and dusk hunts.A final act tha","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T00:06:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114034513","verified_at":"2026-10-23T03:28:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4832770-1847286114034508","game_id":"steam-4832770","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Real Ballistics, Aim Helpers, Medals & a Guided Tutorial","summary":"Thank you for all the feedback during Steam Next Fest! A lot of it went straight into this update. Here is what's new in the demo:Real ballisticsBullets now travel and drop. At long range you need to lead moving animals and hold over a little.Scopes are zeroed, and holdover marks show where to aim at 100-400 m.A visible bullet trail shows where your shot went.The bullet cam follows the real flight path, and HEADSHOT appears when the bullet actually lands.Aim helpersA lead marker shows where to a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T00:05:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114034508","verified_at":"2026-10-23T03:28:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4832770-1847286114027151","game_id":"steam-4832770","kind":"announcement","title":"LIVE: Hunters Trial Demo Gameplay – Steam Next Fest","summary":"Tune in any time — we're streaming Hunters Trial: One Breath demo gameplay around the clock until the end of Steam Next Fest. No commentary, just the quiet of the wild.What you'll seeFixed-position, scope-only hunting: one position, one breath, one shotHolding your breath to steady the scope, and slow-motion shots through a bolting herdTrials straight from the demoPlay it yourselfThe demo is playable right now, and the full game arrives on November 2, 2026. If you enjoy it, please add Hunters Tr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T00:41:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027151","verified_at":"2026-10-21T08:11:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4832770-1840310314346455","game_id":"steam-4832770","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46170771/429680d2d7b0c7537964b3c02d7b4fde444ec2f7.png Thank you for all the feedback on the demo. Here is the first round of fixes and improvements. Fixed several menu issues Reworked scoped aiming: a separate mouse sensitivity setting for the scope, plus zoom balancing Smoother animal movement Improved kill-cam presentation Various stability and polish fixes Keep the feedback coming — more updates are on the way.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-07T23:14:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314346455","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4832770":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:31:26Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:31:25Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4832770":"2026-10-26T14:31:26Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4832770":{"las